1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Thaum xub thawj, tsuas pom ib lub pob zeb dub thiab dej ntawm nws ib sab. Dej hiav txwv maj mam nce thiab nqis.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Ces lub koob yees duab tsa siab. Lub pob zeb yog ib feem ntawm phab ntsa, thiab phab ntsa yog ib feem ntawm ib lub nroog txawv kawg.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Cov kwj dej cais tej kob me. Cov ncej pob zeb sib tshooj. Dhau ntawd yog dej hiav txwv dav mus txog qhov muag pom kawg.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Qhov no yog Nan Madol, nyob ntawm Pohnpei, hauv lub teb chaws Micronesia, sab hnub poob ntawm Dej Hiav Txwv Pacific.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Luag hu tias lub nroog ua saum dej. Tiam sis cov pob zeb tsis ntab. Qhov txawv me no hloov peb txoj kev to taub.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Cov neeg tsim thaj chaw sawv hauv dej ntiav ntawm ntug hiav txwv. Lawv hloov cov thaj chaw ntawd ua lub hauv paus tswj hwm.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Thawj lo lus nug yog yooj yim: lawv coj pob zeb hnyav ntau npaum no los li cas, thaum tsis muaj tshuab zoo li niaj hnub?

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Tseem muaj lus nug nyuaj dua: ua cas ho xaiv qhov chaw uas av, dej thiab kev tu vaj tse yuav tsum sib haum tas li?

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Ib zaj lus piav txaus ntshai tsim tau yooj yim. Tiam sis lus teb pab tau yuav tsum pib ntawm ntug dej, pob zeb thiab neeg.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Cov zej zog uas paub lawv lub ntiaj teb dej hiav txwv yog cov tsim Nan Madol. Peb nyob deb ntawm lawv tsis txhais tias lawv ua tsis tau.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Ntau yam txog kev thauj thiab kev tsim tseem tsis paub meej. Qhov tsis paub caw peb tshawb, tsis yog caw peb lam tsim dab neeg.

12
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Peb yuav taug dej ntawm tej phab ntsa, ces rov taug pob zeb txoj kev los, kom pom txoj hauj lwm uas tsim lub nroog.

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Peb yuav cais peb yam: tej pov thawj tseem tshuav, tej keeb kwm zej zog nco, thiab tej kev xav uas kev tshawb fawb txhawb tau.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Ib yam tsis ua rau lwm yam ploj nqi. Thaum muab saib ua ke, peb paub ntau dua li hu tias tsuas yog qhov chaw piav tsis tau.

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Cia li nco thawj lub pob zeb ntawd. Thaum txog zaj kawg, tib daim nplaim dub yuav tsa ib lo lus nug tshiab.

16
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Pohnpei yog kob siab uas los ntawm roob hluav taws. Sab hauv muaj roob thiab hav zoov noo; ncig kob muaj pob zeb hiav txwv thiab dej ntiav.

17
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Nan Madol nyob ntawm Temwen, sab qab teb hnub tuaj ntawm Pohnpei. Qhov chaw no tseem ceeb dua zaj xav tias nyob cais deb ntawm sawv daws.

18
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Dej cais tau chaw, kuj txuas tau chaw. Rau cov paub tsav nkoj, ntug hiav txwv muaj ntau txoj kev mus los.

19
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Cov pob zeb dub yog pob zeb hluav taws. Thaum lava txias, ib feem tawg ua tej ncej ntev uas muaj ntau ces kaum.

20
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Cov duab ntawd zoo rau ua phab ntsa. Ntuj tsim cov pob zeb, tiam sis neeg tseem yuav xaiv, thauj thiab muab teeb kom haum.

21
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Paub pob zeb los qhov twg xwb tsis tau piav ib lub tsev. Ib yam li hav zoov muaj ntoo, tiam sis tsis muaj tsev ua tiav.

22
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Cov ncej pob zeb pw sib hla ntawm ib txheej mus rau lwm txheej. Phab ntsa zoo li tej thooj ntoo dub loj kawg sib tshooj.

23
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Qab cov phab ntsa tuav av muaj pob zeb hiav txwv tawg thiab lwm yam los ntim. Cov no tsim av tshiab, tsis yog pob zeb nyob dai saum dej.

24
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Cov lus piav feem ntau hais txog cuaj caum cuaj kob uas neeg tsim. Lawv ua ib pawg txuas nrog kwj dej, tsis yog ib daim av loj xwb.

25
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Qhov qub nroog kis thoob ib cheeb tsam ntug dej loj. Tiam sis sawv hauv ib txoj kwj xwb, pom tsis tag nws qhov dav.

26
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Ib qho lem zais lwm lub vaj phab ntsa. Lub nroog tshwm zuj zus ntawm tej qhov rooj thiab chaw nkag, tsis yog ib txoj kev ncaj loj.

27
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Vim li ntawd dej yog ib feem ntawm kev tsim tsev. Nws faib kev mus, tsim ciam, thiab hloov yam uas neeg pom.

28
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Tib txoj dej hloov ntsej muag thaum dej nce nqis. Kev hla nyob ntawm qhov tob, chaw tsuj thiab lub caij kom haum.

29
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Luag hu Nan Madol tias yog Venice ntawm Pacific. Lub npe yooj yim nco, tiam sis lub nroog no tsim nyog muaj nws zaj lus piav.

30
00:04:50,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Pob zeb, kab lig kev cai, keeb kwm thiab ib puag ncig puav leej yog ntawm no. Yuav to taub, peb yuav saib raws qhov chaw no.

31
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Rov qab los ntawm kev thauj pob zeb. Cais ua ob ntu: coj mus txog ntug dej, ces coj mus txog qhov chaw yuav tsa phab ntsa.

32
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Ob ntu muaj teeb meem txawv. Kev nqes hav, ntug dej, dej tob thiab pob zeb tus duab puav leej hloov txoj hauj lwm.

33
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Ib txoj kev uas ua tau tsis tau txhais tias yav tas los ua li ntawd. Kev tshawb yuav nrhiav pov thawj ntawm qhov chaw no.

34
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Kev thauj hauv dej yog ib txoj kev uas luag tham txog. Tiam sis khoom ntab tseem xav tau kev npaj, kev koom tes thiab kev txawj saib.

35
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Kev nqa khoom tso saum nkoj twb nyuaj lawm. Pob zeb hnyav txav me ntsis xwb kuj ua tau kom tsis sib npaug ua ntej yuav mus.

36
00:05:50,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Txoj kev kawg los txog phab ntsa kuj tseem ceeb. Kwj dej uas nkoj me mus tau, tej zaum ris tsis tau ib lub pob zeb loj.

37
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Saum av, pas ncej, chaw txhawb thiab neeg sib pab ua tau hauj lwm hnyav. Tej tswv yim ntawd tsis tas muaj cav tshuab.

38
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Qhov ntawd tsis ua pov thawj tias siv ib txoj kev twg ntawm no. Nws qhia tias peb yuav xub ntseeg neeg txoj kev txawj.

39
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:30,000
Peb pheej xav tias tsa ib lub pob zeb loj yog ib zaug ua tsis taus. Kev tsim tiag yog ntau txoj kev txiav txim me rov ua dua.

40
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Yuav tso lub twg tom ntej? Neeg sawv qhov twg? Qhov twg ris qhov hnyav? Yam twg yuav tsum ruaj ua ntej yuav tsa siab ntxiv?

41
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Phab ntsa tiav lawm zais ntau txoj kev txiav txim ntawd. Tej yam zoo li yooj yim vim cov neeg npaj tau zoo lawm.

42
00:06:50,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Tseem muaj hauj lwm uas tsis tshuav pob zeb qhia: npaj zaub mov, kho nkoj, nrhiav khoom, thiab npaj neeg ua hauj lwm ntev mus.

43
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Lub nroog thiaj tsis yog pob zeb hnyav sib sau xwb. Nws yog yam peb pom ntawm tej kev sib pab uas ua kom hauj lwm mus taus.

44
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Thaum suav cov kev sib pab ntawd, lawv qhov peev xwm tseem loj dua. Peb tsis muab pob zeb piv rau ib tug neeg lub zog xwb.

45
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Peb pom ib zej zog uas txawj coj kev paub, khoom siv thiab kev ua hauj lwm mus rau qhov chaw lawv saib tseem ceeb.

46
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Ua cas ho xaiv dej? Ntug hiav txwv muaj kev mus thiab khoom noj, tiam sis kuj muaj tej hauj lwm tu uas tsis txawj tas.

47
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Dej tshiab yog ib yam yuav tsum muaj. Muaj dej puag ncig tsis txhais tias cov dej ntawd haus tau yam nyab xeeb.

48
00:07:50,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Zaub mov kuj zoo li ntawd. Txawm ua dab tsi hauv lub nroog, cov neeg tseem vam teb, kev pauv khoom thiab cov neeg nyob sab nraud.

49
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Phab ntsa pob zeb piav tsis tag zaj no. Peb yuav saib dhau nws mus rau teb, chaw nuv ntses thiab tej zej zog nyob ze.

50
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Qhov kev vam no hloov peb txoj kev xav txog hwj chim. Lub chaw uas zoo li nyob tau nws tus kheej tseem vam lwm qhov chaw.

51
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Tej kwj dej pab faib kev mus thiab kev nkag. Lawv kuj ua kom tus paub dej thiab ntug hiav txwv muaj kev paub tseem ceeb.

52
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Paub chaw nres nkoj, caij dej haum thiab txoj kev nkaum cua yog tej yam uas ib daim duab qhia tsis tau.

53
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:50,000
Tsis txhob xav tias txhua phab ntsa muaj ib lub hom phiaj xwb. Tib ciam muaj tau ntau txoj hauj lwm siv thiab ntau lub ntsiab.

54
00:08:50,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Phab ntsa tuav av, cais chaw, coj kev lossis qhia qhov tseem ceeb. Tus duab uas tshuav tsis qhia tau txhua yam uas neeg xav.

55
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:10,000
Chaw khoob kuj ua rau xav yuam kev. Qhov chaw ntsiag to hnub no tej zaum yav tas los muaj tsev thiab hauj lwm uas ploj lawm.

56
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Ntoo, nplooj vov tsev thiab khoom siv tsis kav ntev npaum pob zeb. Tej uas tshuav ua rau peb pom pob zeb ntau dua neeg lub neej.

57
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Vim li no tej tsev qub dag tau peb qhov muag. Lawv qhia daim qauv ruaj tshaj, tsis yog tag nrho qhov chaw thaum muaj neeg nyob.

58
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:40,000
Xav txog ib lub tsev uas ru tsev, rooj tog, zaub mov thiab kev ua neej ploj tas. Lub hauv paus teb tau ib co lus nug xwb.

59
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:50,000
Ntawm Nan Madol, tej yam ploj lawm xav kom rov piav yam ceev faj. Peb yuav qhia meej qhov twg muaj pov thawj, qhov twg yog qauv.

60
00:09:50,000 --> 00:10:00,000
Lub nroog tsis yog lus nug txog qhov hnyav xwb. Nws kuj yog kev pub neeg nyob, tswj chaw nkag thiab qhia hwj chim.

61
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:10,000
Nan Madol txuas nrog cov thawj coj Saudeleur. Lawv lub chaw tswj hwm thiab ua kab ke tsim zuj zus dhau ntau pua xyoo.

62
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:20,000
Feem ntau luag muab lub qub nroog pob zeb loj tso rau lub caij txij xyoo ib txhiab ob puas mus txog ib txhiab tsib puas.

63
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Lub caij dav ntawd tsis yog hnub tsim txhua lub tsev. Tej ntu tsim, siv, kho thiab hloov thaum sib txawv.

64
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:40,000
Ib lub chaw tswj hwm tsis yog chaw nyob rau cov neeg muaj hwj chim xwb. Nws kuj siv qhov chaw los qhia kev sib txawv ntawm neeg.

65
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:50,000
Kev tuaj dhau dej ua rau tos ntsoov. Qhov rooj nqaim coj qhov muag. Phab ntsa siab thiab hnyav hloov neeg txoj kev xav txog qhov loj.

66
00:10:50,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Peb rov paub tsis tau txhua tus qhua yav dhau los xav li cas. Tiam sis vaj tse tseem qhia tias qhov chaw tsim kev sib cais li cas.

67
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:10,000
Lub vaj phab ntsa hu ua Nandowas txuas nrog kev faus neeg muaj meej mom thiab kab ke. Nws tsis yog zej zog nyob dog dig xwb.

68
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Nws tej phab ntsa loj yog yam neeg nco tau tshaj. Qhov loj txaus xav kawg, txawm tseem tsis tau nug tias leej twg thiaj nkag tau.

69
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:30,000
Chaw faus neeg txuas hwj chim rau kev nco. Ib tug thawj coj txoj meej mom tseem cuam tshuam qhov chaw tom qab nws tuag lawm.

70
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:40,000
Peb tsis tas tsim ib qho kab ke los piav qhov ntawd. Saib txoj kev nkag khoob yam hwm xwb kuj qhia tau ntau lawm.

71
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Kev tsim vaj tse loj coj neeg mloog thiab neeg lub zog los rau ib lub chaw. Pob zeb nyob ruaj ua rau txoj cai zoo li kav ntev.

72
00:11:50,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Tiam sis pob zeb ruaj tsis yog hwj chim kav mus li. Phab ntsa tseem nyob tsis txhais tias txoj kev tswj uas tsim nws tseem nyob.

73
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:10,000
Ntawm no, zaj lus nug hloov. Yam nyuaj tej zaum yog hwj chim thiab kev vam lwm tus, tsis yog seb pob zeb muab tshooj puas tau.

74
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Leej twg hu neeg ua hauj lwm? Leej twg muab mov? Cov zej zog sab nraud muaj tes dej num dab tsi? Pob zeb teb tau ib feem xwb.

75
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:30,000
Mus txuas ntxiv, peb xav tau lwm hom pov thawj: tej keeb kwm uas neeg Pohnpei nco thiab qhia dhau ntau tiam.

76
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Keeb kwm hais qhov ncauj tsis yog khoom kho kom qhov chaw zoo nkauj. Nws qhia neeg yog leej twg, hwj chim thiab kev txuas rau yav dhau los.

77
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Muaj zaj nto moo hais txog ob tug kwv tij uas tsim lub nroog, thiab pob zeb uas txav tau los ntawm lub zog tshaj neeg.

78
00:12:50,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Peb hwm zaj ntawd tau yam tsis hu khawv koob ua txoj kev tsim uas muaj pov thawj. Nws tus nqi kab lis kev cai tsis nyob ntawm qhov ntawd.

79
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Kev tshawb qub txeeg qub teg nug txawv: siv khoom dab tsi, tsim ntu twg ua ntej, thiab tej khoom nyob hauv av qhia tau dab tsi.

80
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:20,000
Kev ntsuas hnub nyoog muaj nqis, tiam sis yuav tsum txhais kom yog. Ib qho qauv hnub nyoog tsis yog hnub nyoog ntawm tag nrho lub tsev.

81
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Tus tshawb yuav nug tias qhov qauv tuaj qhov twg, nkag rau phab ntsa li cas, thiab puas muaj dab tsi tom qab txav nws chaw lawm.

82
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Ntau txoj pov thawj sib txhawb thaum sib haum. Thaum tsis haum, lawv qhib lus nug tshiab, tsis yog ua rau txhua yam tsis muaj nqis.

83
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:50,000
Kev nco tej zaum muab keeb kwm txuas rau ib tug neeg. Chav kuaj ntsuas khoom. Ob txoj kev tsis hais tib yam tas li.

84
00:13:50,000 --> 00:14:00,000
Vim li no, tus piav yuav tsis muab txhua yam tsis paub ua kev sib tw ntawm kev tshawb fawb thiab kev cai qub.

85
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Keeb kwm hais qhov ncauj kuj piav txoj cai Saudeleur xaus thiab Isokelekel tuaj txog. Nws yog ib tug neeg tseem ceeb hauv Pohnpei txoj kev nco.

86
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Cov ntsiab me thiab lub caij hloov ntawd yuav tsum hais ceev faj. Zaj txaus mloog tsis ua rau txhua daim duab muaj tseeb tas nrho.

87
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:30,000
Tsis txhob muab ib zaug tuaj txog piav txhua yam uas hloov tom qab. Ib lub nroog feem ntau tsis hloov vim ib qho laj thawj xwb.

88
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:40,000
Hauv zaj yeeb yaj kiab no, tej seem yog pov thawj; qauv yog kev piav; thiab keeb kwm hais qhov ncauj yuav qhia tias yog keeb kwm hais qhov ncauj.

89
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Txoj kev no tseem cia peb xav tsis thoob. Tsuas muab qhov xav tsis thoob tso nrog neeg keeb kwm, tsis yog sab nraud neeg peev xwm.

90
00:14:50,000 --> 00:15:00,000
Nws coj peb mus rau qhov tseem ceeb: ib qho chaw tseem muaj nqi tom qab cov txheej txheem hwj chim uas nyob ntawd hloov lawm.

91
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:10,000
Qhua nyiam hu tias chaw tso tseg. Lo lus qhia tau ib txoj hauj lwm xaus, tiam sis kuj muab tej kev txuas tseem muaj zais lawm.

92
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Nan Madol tsis ploj ntawm keeb kwm thaum nws lub hwj chim nqis. Nws tseem muaj ntsiab hauv kev paub, kev cai thiab kev nco ntawm cov neeg.

93
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:30,000
Ib lub qub nroog tsis cia li ua cuab tam tsis muaj tswv. Kev nkag thiab kev txhais cuam tshuam cov neeg uas txuas rau qhov chaw ntev lawm.

94
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:40,000
Qhov chaw tsim hauv dej ntiav xav tau kev tu tas mus li. Dej nqa av tuaj, nroj tsuag hlob, thiab pob zeb hloov raws huab cua.

95
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Tej yam me hloov dej txoj kev khiav. Ib txoj kwj uas dej mus yooj yim yuav maj mam txawv thaum tej av khib nyiab sau ntxiv.

96
00:15:50,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Nroj tsuag tiv thaiv tau ib co nplaim, tiam sis cag kuj thawb tau pob zeb. Kev tu tsis yog rho txhua yam ntsuab tawm xwb.

97
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Qhov chaw no tsis yog tshuab uas nres thaum cov neeg tsim tawm mus. Vaj tse, ntuj tsim thiab huab cua tseem sib cuam tshuam.

98
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:20,000
Ib daim duab thiaj tseem qhia tsis tag. Nws zais tej kev hloov ntawm ib zaug tuaj mus rau lwm zaug, thiab ntawm ib xyoos mus rau lwm xyoo.

99
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:30,000
Tsis yog yuav nug tias ntuj lossis neeg txoj kab lis kev cai yog tus tswv. Ob yam twb sib xyaw hauv txoj kev ua kom qhov chaw nyob tau.

100
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:40,000
Qhua pom nroj tsuag zoo nkauj ntawm pob zeb dub. Tus tu cuab tam tej zaum pom txoj dej txhaws lossis phab ntsa uas yuav tsum tshuaj xyuas.

101
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:50,000
Ob txoj kev pom sib pab tau. Kev zoo nkauj caw neeg saib; kev paub qhia tias yuav saib xyuas yam twg kom zoo.

102
00:16:50,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Tej qub tsev no kuj tawm tsam lub tswv yim tias cov zej zog Pacific ua tsis taus tej hauj lwm loj thiab sib koom ntev.

103
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:10,000
Ntawm no muaj pov thawj txog kev npaj thiab kev ua hauj lwm ntev. Peb yuav to taub lawv lub ntiaj teb yam tsis saib lawv qis.

104
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Hais tias cov tsim ua tsis tau ua rau zaj txawv dua, tiam sis piav tsawg dua. Kev hwm pib ntawm kev lees lawv peev xwm.

105
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Thaum lees qhov lawv ua, peb kuj yuav lees tias kev khaws cia yog ib tes dej num tiag, tsis yog ib zaj dab neeg zoo xwb.

106
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:40,000
Xyoo ob txhiab kaum rau, Nan Madol nkag rau daim npe cuab tam ntiaj teb, thiab kuj nkag rau daim npe cuab tam uas raug kev hem.

107
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:50,000
Qhov no tsis txhais tias lub nroog yuav ploj ib hmos. Nws qhia tias tej nqi tseem ceeb xav tau kev saib xyuas tas mus li.

108
00:17:50,000 --> 00:18:00,000
Tej kev txhawj muaj av txhaws kwj dej thiab nroj tsuag hlob tsis muaj kev tswj. Ob yam txuas ncaj rau txoj dej khiav hauv qhov chaw.

109
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:10,000
Tiv thaiv ib phab ntsa tej zaum yuav tsum to taub tag nrho cheeb tsam. Qhov teeb meem pib tau deb ntawm lub pob zeb uas pom.

110
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Kev yees duab rov qab, kev tshuaj xyuas thiab kev sau ntawv pab pom kev hloov. Tib neeg txoj kev nco ib leeg ntsuas tsis tau txhua yam.

111
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Kev kho muaj lus nug nyuaj: yam twg txhawb, yam twg cia nyob, thiab yuav ua li cas kom tsis rhuav tej pov thawj muaj nqi?

112
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:40,000
Ib daim duab ua ntej thiab tom qab zoo nkauj hloov tsis tau txoj kev txiav txim. Chaw huv dua tsis tau txhais tias qhia keeb kwm tseeb dua.

113
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Cov neeg hauv zos yuav tsum koom tes. Qhov no yog chaw kab lis kev cai tseem muaj sia; kev npaj yuav tsum muaj kev sib ntseeg.

114
00:18:50,000 --> 00:19:00,000
Kev mus ncig coj tau nyiaj thiab neeg saib. Tiam sis kuj tsim teeb meem yog qhua tsis hwm ciam lossis nce phab ntsa thaij duab.

115
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:10,000
Tus qhua zoo taug txoj kev tso cai, mloog neeg hauv zos, thiab tsis txav pob zeb, khoom qub, nroj tsuag lossis tej chaw tiv thaiv.

116
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:20,000
Tus yees duab kuj muaj tes dej num. Lub kaum zoo nkauj yuav tsum tsis yuam nkag chaw txwv, txav pob zeb lossis kom neeg ua kab ke.

117
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:30,000
Duab saum nruab ntug pab qhia qhov chaw, tiam sis yuav tsum tau kev tso cai haum. Pom saum ntuj tau tsis txhais tias muaj cai ya.

118
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Hauv peb zaj no, tej qauv pab piav kev tsim tsev. Peb tsis ua txuj tias yog kev tshawb pom tshiab lossis daim duab yav dhau los meej tas.

119
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Txoj kev no cia tej yam tsis paub tseem pom. Peb piav kev ua tau, tiam sis tsis kaw lus teb thaum tseem tsis muaj pov thawj txaus.

120
00:19:50,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Lub hom phiaj tsis yog kom lub nroog tsis txaus xav. Yog kom hloov lus hais tsis meej ua lus nug tsim nyog tshawb thiab pov thawj tsim nyog khaws.

121
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Tam sim no cia rov taug zaj lus: ntawm cov phab ntsa uas pom, rov mus rau tej kev sib pab uas peb saib tsis tau ncaj lawm.

122
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:20,000
Phab ntsa xav tau pob zeb xaiv. Pob zeb xav tau kev thauj. Kev thauj xav tau kev paub, caij haum, kev npaj thiab neeg sib pab.

123
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Cov neeg xav tau mov, dej, cuab yeej thiab kev sib raug zoo. Lub tsev vam ib lub ntiaj teb dav dua nws tej ciam uas tseem tshuav.

124
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Kev tswj hwm thiab kab ke coj txoj hauj lwm mus. Vaj tse qhia hwj chim; dej pab faib kev, qhov rooj thiab ciam ntawm qhov chaw.

125
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:50,000
Thaum caij dhau, txoj kev tswj hloov. Pob zeb tseem nyob, tiam sis nws lub ntsiab tsis nres rau hnub tsim lossis hnub txoj cai xaus.

126
00:20:50,000 --> 00:21:00,000
Kev cai coj keeb kwm mus ntxiv. Kev tshawb ntxiv tswv yim. Cov zej zog niaj hnub tseem nrhiav kev to taub thiab saib xyuas qhov lawv txais los.

127
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Qhov no nplua nuj dua zaj hais tias nroog nyob dhau keeb kwm: muaj chaw nyob, txuj ci, siab xav, kev vam, kev nco thiab lus nug.

128
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:20,000
Tej yam tseem tsis paub muaj nqis. Kev tshawb yav tom ntej tej zaum qhia hnub nyoog, pob zeb los qhov twg thiab tej ntu tsim li cas.

129
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:30,000
Tiam sis tsis tas tos txhua lo lus teb mam lees qhov tseeb: cov zej zog tib neeg yog cov ua qhov chaw zoo kawg no.

130
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:40,000
Thiab peb txoj kev txiav txim hnub no cuam tshuam seb pov thawj, ib puag ncig thiab ntsiab kab lis kev cai yuav tshuav npaum li cas rau yav tom ntej.

131
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:50,000
Rov saib thawj lub pob zeb. Nws tus duab los ntawm roob hluav taws yog ib zaj; nws qhov chaw hauv phab ntsa yog lwm zaj.

132
00:21:50,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Dej ntawm nws ib sab tsis yog yeeb ncuab uas swb tas, thiab tsis yog duab tom qab xwb. Dej yog ib feem ntawm lub nroog lub neej txuas ntxiv.

133
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:10,000
Nan Madol nug tias neeg tsim nrog ntug hiav txwv nyuaj li cas, thiab peb yuav saib xyuas tej uas lawv tso tseg li cas.

134
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:18,000
Dej tseem nce nqis. Pob zeb tseem nyob. Peb txoj kev to taub los yuav tsum mus ntxiv.
